1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,900
What if your phone died…
and you did too?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Meet him.
He had everything…

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,000
…except time
for what mattered.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
His heart was busy…
chasing likes and DMs.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,900
He chased the title.

6
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,000
The promotion.
The corner office.

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
BUGATTI.

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,000
ROLLS-ROYCE.

9
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,300
A villa on the hill.

10
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,000
First class
to everywhere…

11
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,400
He went everywhere…

12
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,000
…except the one place
Allah invited him.

13
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,400
Then one ordinary night—

14
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,000
His soul rose…
and saw his own body.

15
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Still. Cold.
No more chances.

16
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,500
They washed him.

17
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Wrapped him in white.

18
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,200
Carried him…

19
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,000
…and left him ALONE
in the ground.

20
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,400
Then the ground shook.

21
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,000
Two angels came…
Munkar and Nakir.

22
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,600
مَنْ رَبُّكَ؟
Who is your Lord?

23
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,200
مَا دِينُكَ؟
What is your religion?

24
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,800
مَنْ نَبِيُّكَ؟
Who is your prophet?

25
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,000
Hah… hah…
I… I don't know…

26
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,600
He was struck
with a hammer of iron.

27
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,500
He screamed…

28
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,000
…and no one above
could hear him.

29
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,500
No prayers came
from his children.

30
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,600
He never taught them.

31
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,000
And his sins
kept growing…

32
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
…because he never
guided his family.

33
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Now… his life in Barzakh
is very BUSY.

34
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,800
But you…
are still breathing.

35
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,800
You can change your story,
starting now.

36
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,400
Do your duty.
Teach your family.

37
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,300
Give sadaqah.

38
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,300
In your rizq…
is someone else's rizq.

39
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,800
Your phone will die one day.

40
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,600
So will you.

41
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,000
Share this…
before it's too late.

42
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,500
Who will answer for you?
